    "「%@」上目前沒有可清除的 Henge 系統或安裝檔（您的其他個人檔案未受影響）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” currently has no Henge system or installation files to clear. Your other personal files are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」上目前沒有可清除的 Henge 系統或安裝檔（您的其他個人檔案未受影響）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不是預期的 iPac 檔案，已停止清除以保護資料。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” is not the expected iPac file. Clearing stopped to protect your data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」不是預期的 iPac 檔案，已停止清除以保護資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不是預期的 iPac 檔案，未刪除任何檔案。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
