    "30 Hz 最省效能、60 Hz 最流暢（非 120 Hz 機型會自動限制於 60 Hz）。以上設定將於下次啟動 Mac 時套用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "30 Hz uses the least processing power; 60 Hz is smoother. Devices without a 120 Hz display are limited to 60 Hz. These settings apply the next time the Mac starts."
