    "App 配額餘量不是全機空閒 RAM。大記憶體權限與 No Footprint 不會增加實體記憶體；配置只警示，不強制預留。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App allowance is not the device's free RAM. Increased Memory Limit and No Footprint do not add physical memory. Allocation warnings do not enforce a reserve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 配額餘量不是全機空閒 RAM。大記憶體權限與 No Footprint 不會增加實體記憶體；配置只警示，不強制預留。"
