    "僅使用行動網路時，即使 LocalDevVPN 顯示已連線，iOS 仍可能誤將流量送到行動網路。請在控制中心關閉「行動數據」2 秒後重開，或暫時連上任一 Wi-Fi（熱點亦可）。保持 LocalDevVPN 連線並關閉 Tailscale 等其他 VPN 後重試。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On cellular-only connections, iOS may send traffic over cellular even when LocalDevVPN appears connected. Turn Cellular Data off for two seconds in Control Center, then back on, or temporarily connect to Wi-Fi or a hotspot. Keep LocalDevVPN connected, turn off other VPNs such as Tailscale, and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
