    "會確認目前無執行中的虛擬機或安裝作業，釋放 Henge 對「%@」的存取權限與紀錄，完整保留 SSD 內的系統與所有個人資料。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checks that no virtual machine or installation is running, then releases Henge's access and records for “%@”. The system and all personal data on the SSD are preserved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會確認目前無執行中的虛擬機或安裝作業，釋放 Henge 對「%@」的存取權限與紀錄，完整保留 SSD 內的系統與所有個人資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會確認目前無執行中的虛擬機或檔案傳輸，釋放 Henge 對「%@」的存取權限與掛載紀錄。外接 SSD 內的系統與所有個人資料都會完整保留，之後插到這台或別台 iPad 皆可隨時重新開啟。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checks that no virtual machine or file transfer is running, then releases Henge's access and mount records for “%@”. The system and all personal data on the SSD are preserved and can be opened later on this or another iPad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會確認目前無執行中的虛擬機或檔案傳輸，釋放 Henge 對「%@」的存取權限與掛載紀錄。外接 SSD 內的系統與所有個人資料都會完整保留，之後插到這台或別台 iPad 皆可隨時重新開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
