    "每次啟動 Henge 僅能執行一個應用程式。輕點為左鍵、單指捲動、雙指拖曳、長按為右鍵；鍵盤按鈕可叫出輸入。結束後請上滑關閉 Henge。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only one app can run per Henge launch. Tap to left-click, scroll with one finger, drag with two fingers, and long-press to right-click. Use the keyboard button for input. Swipe up to close Henge when finished."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
