    "減少模擬 CPU 的繪圖負荷：關閉視窗動畫、Dock 動畫、桌面小工具與動態桌布。請先開啟 Mac 終端機，點按按鈕後按 Return 執行，並登出再登入即可生效（建議另於系統設定開啟「減少動態效果」與「減少透明度」）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reduce emulated CPU rendering work by disabling window and Dock animations, desktop widgets, and dynamic wallpapers. Open Terminal on the Mac, tap the button, press Return, then sign out and back in. Also consider enabling Reduce Motion and Reduce Transparency in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "減少模擬 CPU 的繪圖負荷：關閉視窗動畫、Dock 動畫、桌面小工具與動態桌布。請先開啟 Mac 終端機，點按按鈕後按 Return 執行，並登出再登入即可生效（建議另於系統設定開啟「減少動態效果」與「減少透明度」）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
